 | identity
 ↓
IDENTITY PROVIDER
 |
 +---------------------+
 |                     |
DEVICE IDENTITY     DEVICE POSTURE
 |                     |
 +----------+----------+
            ↓
      POLICY ENGINE
            ↓
       AUTHORIZATION
            ↓
        RESOURCE

The architecture becomes significantly stronger than password-only authentication.
